Move mouse cursor in a direction while key is held

Do something like this to move the mouse down and to the right:

hold(
  event(EV_REL, REL_X, 1)
  .event(EV_REL, REL_Y, 2)
  .wait(10)
)

=====

To move the mouse cursor and accelerate while moving:

set(speed, 50)
.hold(
  event(EV_REL, REL_X, 1)
  .event(EV_REL, REL_Y, 2)
  .add(speed, -1)
  .wait($speed)
)

This one did NOT work for me 2025-01-01

